The service becomes:

TrackingResourceWebClientService
          ↓
     retryWhen()
          ↓
      RetryConfig
          ↓
     isRetryable()
          ↓
      retryable?
       ↙       ↘
     YES        NO
      ↓          ↓
doBeforeRetry   Error
      ↓
log exception
+ attempt
+ status
      ↓
    Retry
