log final exception

One thing to check

This class already has handleErrorMap() logging the final exception. So after adding:

logRetryExhausted()

you may get a duplicate final-error log.

I'd first test the actual flow locally. If you see:

Retry attempt 1
Retry attempt 2
Retry attempt 3
Retries exhausted
API request failed

and the last two are effectively the same information, we can optimize it so that retry attempts are logged centrally and the existing handleErrorMap() remains responsible for the final API error.